        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"On hearing that order of the king those best courtesans have entered that great forest, and they camped not very far from that hermitage, making all the trials for showing themselves off to a glance of that sage. [1-10-7]"
      }
